OL,3,GNEWSAFamily welcomes review of law
OL,4,Aafter driver who killed daughter ruled
OL,5,Aunfit to stand trial
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of a woman killed after a
OL,8,Fhigh-speed race through residential
OL,9,Fstreets says it is a "relief" the
OL,10,Fgovernment was considering changing the
OL,11,Flaw around defendants who are
OL,12,Fconsidered unfit to stand trial.
OL,14,FSophie Brimble, 20, died after her
OL,15,Fboyfriend, Jay Bayliss, crashed into a
OL,16,Flamp-post in Brynmawr, Blaenau Gwent,
OL,17,Fin July 2017, while driving at almost
OL,18,Fthree times the speed limit. He was
OL,19,Fdeemed too badly injured for criminal
OL,20,Fproceedings.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
