OL,3,GNEWSAFamily welcomes review of law
OL,4,Aafter driver who killed daughter ruled
OL,5,Aunfit to stand trial
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family launched a petition to give
OL,8,Fcourts greater powers in similar cases,
OL,9,Fafter Bayliss was again declared unfit
OL,10,Fin 2026.
OL,12,FThe Ministry of Justice (MoJ) said it
OL,13,F"agrees the law needs updating and is
OL,14,Fconsidering reforms".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
